      "number": 1,
      "points": 8,
      "stem": "If $|\\mathbf{u}| \\ne \\mathbf{0}$ and $|\\mathbf{v}| \\ne \\mathbf{0}$ and $|\\mathbf{u}+\\mathbf{v}| = |\\mathbf{u}|+|\\mathbf{v}|$, which of the following statements is correct?",
      "choices": [
